d\": \"k:response-preference-faq@1.1:fa9b6a3d\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"response-preference-faq@1.1\", \"title\": \"Response Preference — FAQ (v1.1)\", \"sections\": [\"Instruction following\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"response-preference-faq\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"faq\", \"record_kind\": \"faq\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-05T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-05T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"response_preference\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U001\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Instruction following\\n\\n### Q: The prompt required JSON, but one response is well-written prose. Which response wins?\\nThe required format is not optional: record its violation separately from factual accuracy. No universal tie-break rule is established for competing accuracy and instruction-following defects. If the actual pair and applicable guidance do not settle the preference, provide the prompt and both responses for TL confirmation.\\n\\n### Q: Can accuracy outweigh ignoring a requested output structure?\\nScore the dimensions separately and identify whether the requested structure was mandatory. Do not infer a general priority rule from one example or decide without the other response's evidence.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:slack:C_RP_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790929075.000039:05d4b538\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {